f contains only this file.\\nPreserve all fixture tooling and repository rules. A nonzero checker exit is a failure.\\n\",\"location\":\"prompt:smoke.spec.md\",\"path\":\"smoke.spec.md\",\"sha256\":\"027d6f6ee147ecb9506d4d7a9ca4639c66a75a3b0897a349057cd13ca8c34342\"},{\"commit\":\"\",\"content\":\"# Smoke implementation Plan\\n\\n1. Read the frozen Spec with an explicit UTF-8 decoder.\\n2. Read current UTC and write only `evidence/native-101.md` in the exact format,\\n   encoded as UTF-8 without a BOM and with a final newline.\\n3. Run `powershell.exe -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File ./sr-smoke/check.ps1`.\\n4. Inspect the actual exit code and diff. Report the observed verification result.\\n\",\"location\":\"prompt:smoke.plan.md\",\"path\":\"smoke.plan.md\",\"sha256\":\"4d38ebcf448c4be9623a9d882dbde81ce3a8e680c14fd9739d39a1c20d4c9515\"}]","--enter","--retry-request","eae6efac-2996-4db7-af06-a99a12622575","--json","--wait-submit","20","--environment","e68f4edf-8a83-42c2-a9da-6d404d3aa3d8"],"at":"2026-10-20T05:19:35.6864996Z","ended_at":null,"failed":null}
